<title>USA: Warren Cty RJC, Ky., won by Banc One.</title>
<headline>Warren Cty RJC, Ky., won by Banc One.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banc One Capital Corp., said it won $3.235 million of Warren Cty Regional Jail Corp., Ky., public project revenue bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.14 percent.</p>
</text>
